    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103489" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρᾰ-πλόος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρᾰ-πλοῦς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆ</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fourfold</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ τετραπλοῦ μισθοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					9.1055.13
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετραμοιρία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.6.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδίδωμι τετραπλοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					19.8
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πλῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>3 Ki.</u>
					6.31(33)
				</span></i>
			. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπλόος</span>.)</div>
